---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SystemDiagram from "../components/SystemDiagram.astro";
import DataPath from "../components/exhibits/DataPath.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Platform"
  description="Datafore works on top of your practice management system: it combines your clinic data, flags what needs attention, turns it into follow-up, and tracks the result."
>
  <!-- Hero: the statement, then the integration map as the first thing you see -->
  <section class="bg-mist">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 pt-20 md:pt-28 lg:px-10 lg:pb-28">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
        <h1 class="max-w-[18ch] text-[2.75rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.022em] sm:text-6xl lg:col-span-7 lg:text-[4rem]">
          Works on top of the software you already use.
        </h1>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-graphite-700 lg:col-span-5 lg:self-end">
          <p>
            Datafore reads your practice management system, flags what needs attention, makes sure someone follows up,
            and checks whether it worked.
          </p>
          <p>
            Your team keeps working the way it does today. We're connecting systems one at a time during our founding
            phase, starting with Jane App.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 lg:mt-20">
        <SystemDiagram />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Exhibit: the path a patient record takes -->
  <section id="patient-data" class="scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
        <h2 class="text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] md:text-[2.75rem] lg:col-span-5">Built for patient data.</h2>
        <p class="max-w-[52ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-graphite-700 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 lg:self-end">
          Health information is the most sensitive thing a clinic holds. Here is the path one record takes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16">
        <DataPath />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-mist">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-6 py-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-10 lg:py-28">
      <h2 class="text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] md:text-[2.75rem] lg:col-span-5">Benchmarks, as more clinics join.</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-graphite-700 lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
        <p>
          At first, Datafore compares your clinic with itself: practitioner to practitioner, month to month. As more
          clinics join, it will show how your retention and utilisation compare with similar practices.
        </p>
        <p>
          No such benchmark exists for allied health in Canada today. We'll publish one only when enough clinics take
          part to make it meaningful and keep every clinic anonymous.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
